    <title>Episode 170: Episode 170 再见大都会</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6967be448f2346b9546c00bb</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6967be448f2346b9546c00bb</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 14 Jan 2026 15:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<h2><span>再见大都会</span></h2><span></span><p><span>以宋元绘画、佛教造像及青铜礼器为核心，美国大都会艺术博物馆汇集了海外顶尖的中国艺术珍藏。这一收藏始于1870年代，不仅是海外中国艺术收藏的缩影，更凝聚了几代博物馆人与收藏家的远见与心血。从2015年的“纽约照夜白”开始，十年播客路，主播以本期节目和一路同行的听友们惜别。</span></p><span></span><h2><span>相关链接：</span></h2><span></span><ul><span></span><li><a href="https://www.nytimes.com/1988/12/25/obituaries/john-m-crawford-jr-75-dies-eminent-collector-of-chinese-art.html" data-url="https://www.nytimes.com/1988/12/25/obituaries/john-m-crawford-jr-75-dies-eminent-collector-of-chinese-art.html"><span>顾洛阜</span></a></li><span></span><li><a href="https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E5%AE%89%E6%80%9D%E8%BF%9C/11038039" data-url="https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E5%AE%89%E6%80%9D%E8%BF%9C/11038039"><span>安思远</span></a></li><span></span><li><a href="https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E7%8E%8B%E5%AD%A3%E8%BF%81/5062277" data-url="https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E7%8E%8B%E5%AD%A3%E8%BF%81/5062277"><span>王季迁</span></a></li><span></span><li><a href="https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E5%94%90%E9%AA%9D%E5%8D%83/59726497" data-url="https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E5%94%90%E9%AA%9D%E5%8D%83/59726497"><span>唐骝千</span></a></li><span></span></ul>]]></description>
